  "markdown": "![EMPTY ALT](/logo.jpg)\n\n[link] [Afyawise](/)\n\n[link] [Home](/)\n\n[link] [Blog](/blog)\n\n[link] [Shop](/shop)\n\n[link] [Support Us](/support)\n\n[link] [About us](/about)\n\n[link] [Our Work](/work)\n\n[link] [Services](/services)\n\n[link] [Our Impact](/our-impact)\n\n[link] [Our Team](/team)\n\n[link] [Contact Us](/contact)\n\n![EMPTY ALT](/blogImg/img3.jpg)\n\n## Empowering Communities With Knowledge For Better Health\n\nInsights, Stories, and Tips for Wellness and Change\n\n- All\n\n- Nutrition\n\n- Mental Health\n\n- Wellness\n\n- Wash\n\n- Stories\n\nAll blogs are not currently available\n\nSupport our mission to build healthier communities\n\n[button] Donate Now\n\n![Afyawise logo](/logo.jpg)\n\n# Afyawise\n\nPromoting community health and well-being\n\n## Quick Links\n\n- Home  _(links: Home -> /)_\n\n- About  _(links: About -> /about)_\n\n- Our Team  _(links: Our Team -> /team)_\n\n- Our Work  _(links: Our Work -> /work)_\n\n### CONTACT\n\n![Email](Icons/email-white.svg)\n\n[link] [info@afyawise.org](mailto:info@afyawise.org)\n\n![Phone](Icons/phone-color.svg)\n\n[link] [+254798724766](tel:+254798724766)\n\n![Location](Icons/location-color.svg)\n\nKarama Ward, Meru County, Kenya\n\n© 2025 AfyaWise CBO. All rights reserved.",
